Every attempt returned Connected, echo netbird-hdc-smoke, uname "Linux localhost 5.10.210 #1 SMP Mon May 18 09:32:07 CST 2026 x86_64 Toybox", and OS distribution "HarmonyOS".
Every boot.completed query returned: Get parameter "bootevent.boot.completed" fail! errNum is:106!
A full param listing contained service boot-time values but no bootevent.boot.completed key. Kernel logs showed the boot.completed watcher was registered, but no completed value was observed. Readiness verdict: FAIL because boot.completed was not true; Connected was not treated as sufficient.

