[result]
Overall verdict=blocked
Readiness=failed because bootevent.boot.completed never returned true in either cold run; echo, uname, and HarmonyOS distribution passed while HDC was healthy.
Unsigned HAP installation=passed on the API 24 Emulator; this is only current-measured behavior of this research image and does not establish production signing or distribution behavior.
Ability launch=blocked with Error Code 10106102 because the Emulator screen was locked/unavailable; the standard wake and swipe attempt did not change the result.
HiLog ping/version=not verified because EntryAbility did not launch and no R1Api24Probe lines were observed.
Stop/uninstall=passed; the bundle was force-stopped, uninstalled, and absent on post-uninstall query before normal Emulator shutdown.
Research boundary=This Emulator result cannot be used for R1 exit, named-device support, NetBird feasibility, VPN feasibility, product support, signing acceptance, channel acceptance, or release evidence. R0 remains in progress and not exited.
Next blocker=restore an API 24 Emulator instance/display state that reaches bootevent.boot.completed=true and allows a normal EntryAbility launch, then rerun the same fixed HAP smoke; named arm64 device evidence remains mandatory for R0/R1 exit when hardware is available.
